  ok   high shelf -6 dB asymptote                             -5.921 (want -6.000 +-0.600)

[G2] analyser
  ok   white noise is flat over 0.5-8 kHz (spread)             0.000 (want 0.000 +-4.000)
  ok   no pitch on noise                                       0.000 (want 0.000 +-1.000)
  ok   YIN: 220 Hz source measured                           210.000 (want 220.000 +-13.200)

[G3] fault detection on a synthetic take
  (injected: +8 dB Q12 @3150, +7 dB shelf below 150, +4 dB @2800)
